title: "IsoParcel: Equal-area polygon partitioning plugin for QGIS"
abstract: "QGIS plugin for mathematically equal-area partitioning of irregular polygons in cadastral and agricultural applications. Guarantees σ < 0.01% area deviation via adaptive binary-search algorithm."
